you have to choose between elven leather, cornuthaum (if you can find
it) or helm of brilliance.

My one wizard ascention found a HoB right before the ascention run and
enchanted it to +2, only to find that he was smart enough that the
bonuses to int+wis didn't help the spell failure rates anyway. He
ended up leaving the +2 HoB for his +0 elven leather helm because he
was playing without a bag of holding, and it allowed him to carry just
about two potions and a wand more.

